<!-- 1.30.0 霜巨人：可遗传的巨人血统（阶序第4位，在火巨人之下），代谢合计 -3。代码见 Source/FrostGiant.cs，通用规则见 Source/GiantKin.cs。 -->
<Defs>

  <XenotypeDef>
    <defName>LP_FrostGiant</defName>
    <label>霜巨人</label>
    <description>住在冰原与雪山上的巨人族，血脉会遗传给子女。成年霜巨人的体型是常人的2.0倍，皮肤是冻土般的浅蓝灰色，霜白的头发编成结满冰碴的发辫。他们在零下八十度也不会失温，踩着积雪照样大步走，冬狼会像猎犬一样追随他们；他们最怕的是火，也受不了一点暖和天气。霜巨人是天生的掠夺者，打退一场袭击、看着库房里堆满抢来的兵甲，就是他们最大的乐趣。在巨人的阶序里，霜巨人排在火巨人之下——两族是几千年的世仇。</description>
    <descriptionShort>可遗传的巨人种族。2倍巨躯、极耐寒、免疫冻伤失温与寒气、雪地不减速、驯服冬狼、怕火怕热、热爱战利品；冬之号角。</descriptionShort>
    <iconPath>Giants/Genes/FrostGiantCore</iconPath>
    <inheritable>true</inheritable>
    <combatPowerFactor>1.6</combatPowerFactor>
    <genes>
      <li>LP_FrostGiantCore</li>
      <li>LP_FrostSnowWalker</li>
      <li>LP_FrostGiantFrailty</li>
      <li>LP_FrostWolfLord</li>
      <li>LP_FrostLootHeart</li>
      <li>LP_SkinFrost</li>
      <li>LP_HairFrost</li>
      <li>LP_FrostBraids</li>
      <li>Body_Hulk</li>
    </genes>
  </XenotypeDef>

  <GeneDef Name="LP_FrostGiantGeneBase" Abstract="True">
    <displayCategory>Miscellaneous</displayCategory>
    <selectionWeight>0</selectionWeight>
    <biostatCpx>2</biostatCpx>
  </GeneDef>

  <GeneDef ParentName="LP_FrostGiantGeneBase">
    <defName>LP_FrostGiantCore</defName>
    <label>霜巨人本源</label>
    <description>霜巨人的冰原血脉，可随种族遗传。成年后体型为常人的2.0倍（显示1.4倍，儿童随年龄长大）；体型越大，生命和近战越强（巨躯规则：成年生命×150%、近战×130%），步子大却不快。霜巨人不怕冷：舒适温度下限-80℃，不会失温、不会冻伤，寒冰魔的寒气和冬狼咬的寒霜迟缓对他们无效。他们不在乎赤身裸体，能穿普通衣服，也有只有巨人能穿的专属衣甲。戴上霜巨人号角就能吹响“冬之号角”。</description>
    <geneClass>LichPhylactery.Gene_FrostGiant</geneClass>
    <iconPath>Giants/Genes/FrostGiantCore</iconPath>
    <displayCategory>ResistanceAndWeakness</displayCategory>
    <biostatCpx>4</biostatCpx>
    <biostatMet>-3</biostatMet>
    <statFactors>
      <MoveSpeed>0.85</MoveSpeed>
    </statFactors>
    <statOffsets>
      <ComfyTemperatureMin>-80</ComfyTemperatureMin>
    </statOffsets>
    <damageFactors>
      <Frostbite>0</Frostbite>
    </damageFactors>
    <abilities>
      <li>LP_WinterHornBlast</li>
    </abilities>
    <descriptionHyperlinks>
      <AbilityDef>LP_WinterHornBlast</AbilityDef>
      <ThingDef>LP_FrostGiantHorn</ThingDef>
    </descriptionHyperlinks>
    <customEffectDescriptions>
      <li>巨人血统：霜巨人（阶序第4位，低于火巨人）。</li>
      <li>体型随年龄增长，成年达到×2.0（显示×1.4）。</li>
      <li>巨躯规则：成年生命总量×150%、近战伤害×130%（可在模组设置调整；关闭时生命仍×150%）。</li>
      <li>巨胃：饱食度上限随体型提高，成年×200%。</li>
      <li>移动速度：×85%。</li>
      <li>不会失温、不会冻伤；不受“寒气侵体”和“寒霜迟缓”影响。</li>
      <li>不会因裸体产生负面心情；能穿普通衣服，巨人专属衣甲每件心情+2（最多+6）。</li>
      <li>冬之号角：装备霜巨人号角后可用。</li>
    </customEffectDescriptions>
    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="LichPhylactery.GiantKinExtension">
        <rank>4</rank>
        <element>frost</element>
        <label>霜巨人</label>
        <adultSize>2.0</adultSize>
        <renderScale>1.4</renderScale>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
  </GeneDef>

  <GeneDef ParentName="LP_FrostGiantGeneBase">
    <defName>LP_FrostSnowWalker</defName>
    <label>雪原行者</label>
    <description>在没膝的积雪里也能大步走：积雪不会拖慢移动速度。冰天雪地里干活也不觉得冷（没有“寒冷”心情）。</description>
    <iconPath>Giants/Genes/FrostSnowWalker</iconPath>
    <biostatMet>-1</biostatMet>
    <customEffectDescriptions>
      <li>积雪不减速（不影响寻路的绕行判断）。</li>
    </customEffectDescriptions>
  </GeneDef>

  <GeneDef ParentName="LP_FrostGiantGeneBase">
    <defName>LP_FrostGiantFrailty</defName>
    <label>畏火</label>
    <description>霜巨人的身体经不起火烤，也受不了暖和天气：受到的火焰伤害×150%，舒适温度上限-22℃。</description>
    <iconPath>Giants/Genes/FrostGiantFrailty</iconPath>
    <displayCategory>ResistanceAndWeakness</displayCategory>
    <biostatCpx>1</biostatCpx>
    <biostatMet>2</biostatMet>
    <damageFactors>
      <Flame>1.5</Flame>
    </damageFactors>
    <statOffsets>
      <ComfyTemperatureMax>-22</ComfyTemperatureMax>
    </statOffsets>
  </GeneDef>

  <GeneDef ParentName="LP_FrostGiantGeneBase">
    <defName>LP_FrostWolfLord</defName>
    <label>冬狼之主</label>
    <description>冬狼认得霜巨人的气味。驯服冬狼的成功率×300%，北极狼与森林狼×150%（最多100%）；驯服失败或误伤时冬狼不会反噬。以这个霜巨人为主人的冬狼近战伤害×115%、移动速度×110%。</description>
    <iconPath>Giants/Genes/FrostWolfLord</iconPath>
    <displayCategory>Miscellaneous</displayCategory>
    <biostatMet>-1</biostatMet>
  </GeneDef>

  <GeneDef ParentName="LP_FrostGiantGeneBase">
    <defName>LP_FrostLootHeart</defName>
    <label>战利品之心</label>
    <description>霜巨人是天生的掠夺者。打退一场袭击后3天心情+5（战利品）；地图上不是殖民地自己做的武器和护甲（散落或入库的，不算穿在身上的）市值每1000银心情+1，最多+4。</description>
    <iconPath>Giants/Genes/FrostLootHeart</iconPath>
    <biostatMet>0</biostatMet>
  </GeneDef>

  <GeneDef ParentName="GeneSkinColorOverride">
    <defName>LP_SkinFrost</defName>
    <label>冻土肤色</label>
    <labelShortAdj>冻土</labelShortAdj>
    <description>霜巨人浅蓝灰色的皮肤，像冻住的土。</description>
    <skinColorOverride>(164, 186, 204)</skinColorOverride>
    <randomBrightnessFactor>0.06</randomBrightnessFactor>
    <selectionWeight>0</selectionWeight>
    <displayOrderInCategory>1</displayOrderInCategory>
  </GeneDef>
  <GeneDef ParentName="GeneHairColorBase">
    <defName>LP_HairFrost</defName>
    <label>霜白发色</label>
    <description>白得发蓝的头发，像结了一层霜。</description>
    <hairColorOverride>(222, 236, 246)</hairColorOverride>
    <randomBrightnessFactor>0.04</randomBrightnessFactor>
    <selectionWeight>0</selectionWeight>
    <displayOrderInCategory>1</displayOrderInCategory>
  </GeneDef>
  <GeneDef>
    <defName>LP_FrostBraids</defName>
    <label>结霜发辫</label>
    <description>霜巨人把头发编成两条粗辫子，辫梢挂着冰珠和骨环。</description>
    <iconPath>Giants/Genes/FrostGiantCore</iconPath>
    <displayCategory>Cosmetic</displayCategory>
    <selectionWeight>0</selectionWeight>
    <biostatCpx>0</biostatCpx>
    <renderNodeProperties>
      <li>
        <nodeClass>PawnRenderNode_AttachmentHead</nodeClass>
        <workerClass>PawnRenderNodeWorker_FlipWhenCrawling</workerClass>
        <texPath>Giants/FrostBraids/FrostBraids</texPath>
        <color>(255, 255, 255)</color>
        <parentTagDef>Head</parentTagDef>
        <rotDrawMode>Fresh, Rotting</rotDrawMode>
        <drawData>
          <defaultData>
            <layer>80</layer>
          </defaultData>
        </drawData>
      </li>
    </renderNodeProperties>
  </GeneDef>

  <!-- ==================== 冬之号角 ==================== -->
  <AbilityDef Name="LP_WinterHornBase" Abstract="True">
    <iconPath>Giants/Abilities/WinterHorn</iconPath>
    <hostile>false</hostile>
    <targetRequired>false</targetRequired>
    <cooldownTicksRange>60000</cooldownTicksRange>
    <displayGizmoWhileUndrafted>true</displayGizmoWhileUndrafted>
    <disableGizmoWhileUndrafted>false</disableGizmoWhileUndrafted>
    <aiCanUse>false</aiCanUse>
    <verbProperties>
      <verbClass>Verb_CastAbility</verbClass>
      <warmupTime>0.5</warmupTime>
      <range>0</range>
      <targetParams><canTargetSelf>true</canTargetSelf></targetParams>
    </verbProperties>
  </AbilityDef>
  <AbilityDef ParentName="LP_WinterHornBase">
    <defName>LP_WinterHornBlast</defName>
    <label>冬之号角</label>
    <description>霜巨人吹响霜巨人号角（需要装备）：15格内的友方60秒内近战命中+15%、不会被吓倒；15格内的冬狼另外“狂猎”，移动速度×130%。冷却1天。</description>
    <comps>
      <li Class="LichPhylactery.CompProperties_WinterHorn" />
    </comps>
  </AbilityDef>
  <AbilityDef ParentName="LP_WinterHornBase">
    <defName>LP_WinterHornCall</defName>
    <label>狂猎号角</label>
    <description>吹响霜巨人号角。不是霜巨人吹不出号角的全部力量：只有15格内的冬狼会“狂猎”，60秒内移动速度×130%。冷却1天。</description>
    <comps>
      <li Class="LichPhylactery.CompProperties_WinterHorn"><wolvesOnly>true</wolvesOnly></li>
    </comps>
  </AbilityDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>LP_WinterHorn</defName>
    <label>冬之号角</label>
    <description>冬之号角的长鸣还在耳边：近战命中+15%，不会被吓倒。</description>
    <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.75, 0.9, 1)</defaultLabelColor>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <comps><li Class="HediffCompProperties_Disappears"><disappearsAfterTicks>3600</disappearsAfterTicks><showRemainingTime>true</showRemainingTime></li></comps>
  </HediffDef>
  <HediffDef>
    <defName>LP_WildHunt</defName>
    <label>狂猎</label>
    <description>号角一响，冬狼就成了猎群：移动速度×130%。</description>
    <hediffClass>HediffWithComps</hediffClass>
    <defaultLabelColor>(0.75, 0.9, 1)</defaultLabelColor>
    <isBad>false</isBad>
    <comps><li Class="HediffCompProperties_Disappears"><disappearsAfterTicks>3600</disappearsAfterTicks><showRemainingTime>true</showRemainingTime></li></comps>
    <stages><li><statFactors><MoveSpeed>1.3</MoveSpeed></statFactors></li></stages>
  </HediffDef>

  <!-- ==================== 战利品之心 ==================== -->
  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>LP_FrostSpoils</defName>
    <durationDays>3</durationDays>
    <stackLimit>1</stackLimit>
    <stages>
      <li>
        <label>战利品</label>
        <description>打退了敌人！他们丢下的兵器和盔甲，现在都是我们的了。</description>
        <baseMoodEffect>5</baseMoodEffect>
      </li>
    </stages>
  </ThoughtDef>
  <ThoughtDef>
    <defName>LP_FrostLootHoard</defName>
    <workerClass>LichPhylactery.ThoughtWorker_FrostLootHoard</workerClass>
    <stages>
      <li><label>一点战利品</label><description>库房里有些从敌人那儿缴来的兵甲。</description><baseMoodEffect>1</baseMoodEffect></li>
      <li><label>不少战利品</label><description>缴来的兵甲越堆越多了。</description><baseMoodEffect>2</baseMoodEffect></li>
      <li><label>成堆的战利品</label><description>满地都是抢来的兵器和盔甲，真是个好营地。</description><baseMoodEffect>3</baseMoodEffect></li>
      <li><label>掠夺者的宝山</label><description>战利品堆得像山一样高，冰原上的老家都没这么阔气。</description><baseMoodEffect>4</baseMoodEffect></li>
    </stages>
  </ThoughtDef>

  <!-- ==================== 派系成员 ==================== -->
